title: "CatLium EduTech — Authorization Decision Chain (guards)"
---
flowchart TD
    REQ["Incoming HTTP request"]
    AG{"AccessTokenGuard — valid JWT and active sid?"}
    A401["401 Unauthenticated"]
    TG{"TenantGuard — x-institute-id present and member active?"}
    F403["403 Forbidden"]

    REQ --> AG
    AG -->|no| A401
    AG -->|yes| TG
    TG -->|no| F403
    TG -->|yes| RG
    RG{"RequiredRoles — OR semantics, optional"}
    RG -->|fail| F403
    RG -->|pass| PFG